    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with medication-overuse headache on a background of migraine do well once it's treated properly. Let me repeat that back to make sure. You've had headaches most days for two months, severe, and no stiff neck or weakness.",
