      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "We'll begin with amitriptyline, 10 milligrams, at night, long term. That should help with headache prevention. Stop the daily painkillers gradually, the headaches may worsen for a couple of weeks first. A short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think. I'd like to see you again in six weeks. Let me check I've been clear. What will you do once you get home?",
